  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="6d498da7-61fa-5d08-9f65-c243210aa9c4" activityNameId="f3e82eef-c001-5acc-ac88-31d5cddb5904" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Door, inner, wood, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Door, inner, wood, at plant
The dataset can be applied to describe an average room door. The door frame is made of massive wood, the door leaf is made of wood. The lock, door handles and frame joints are fabricated from steel. Data are based on a door of 0.8x2.0 m and scaled to 1m2. 1 m2 of the wooden inner door weighs 27.6 kg. The functional life time for the door frame is 50 years, for the door leaf it is 30 years. \nGeography: Data from producers in Switzerland.\nTechnology: The technology represents average European production.\nVersion: 2.2\nEnergy values: Undefined\nLocal category: Bauteile\nLocal subcategory: Türen\nUVEK 2022 source file:07153.XML\n\n
UUID: a060cbc7-d848-3cfa-8b04-25f97a1a36a4
This dataset describes the production of 1m2 (visible area) inner door, including the processes for the installation. Not included are transports from plant to construction site.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: The technology represents average European production.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Published study, Internet search 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a060cbc7-d848-3cfa-8b04-25f97a1a36a4.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
